OCCUPATION:  N/A
WORLD OF BIRTH:  Brimpie-4, Buoy Station 16
REGISTERED HOMEWORLD:  Brimpie-3
REGISTERED RESIDENCE:  Apartment 907, Habitat Zone 7

ASSOCIATIONS:
  Registered domestic partnership with Calihan Lonan.
  No immediate family on file.

OCCUPATION:
  Former Deep Space Radio Operator and Telemetry Officer.
