text = "Solarian Coalition Personnel Record - AMY RAYEN
[confidential cadet personnel file]

FULL NAME:  Amy Rayen
STATUS:  Registered Citizen
SERVICE ID:  7721-907-AR
OCCUPATION:  Cadet, Solarian Army Corps
WORLD OF BIRTH:  82-G Eridani-d
REGISTERED HOMEWORLD:  82-G Eridani-d
REGISTERED RESIDENCE:  Barracks 1305, Cadet Complex Theta-19

ASSOCIATIONS:
  Maintains close bond with fellow Cadet Corporal Marcus.
  Biological parents identified as two senior-ranking officers (names redacted).
  Parents relationship deemed in violation of Coalition Oath Statute 12-B.

OCCUPATION:
  Currently enlisted in the Solarian Armed Forces reporting to Sergeant Crawford.
  Specialization: Combat Medic

NOTES:
  Previous psychological evaluations note elevated compliance, and surppressed emotional 
  expression. Also signs of introversion and chronic hypervigilance. 
  Most notably around figures of authority.
  
  Tendency to seek isolation. (Roof access violations x12)

  Shows creative tendencies. (unauthorised sketchbook confiscated twice) 

Remarks:
  \"Quiet. Obedient. Keeps her head down. Has potential, but refuses to step forward.\"
  - Drill Instructor P. Varrin, Youth Cadet Corps Division 3.

  \"Her parentage makes her a political liability. Recommend continued observation.\"
  - Commander [REDACTED], Personnel Oversight Committee"
