text = "
Calihan...

I don't blame you if you don't want to hear from me, but there's something I must say. 
I wasn't trying to start a fight with you before you left. 
I just... wanted to talk. Not fight. We've never had an argument until now.

Remember when we used to sit up all night talking? I miss those nights... 
I miss you.

It feels like you've been slowly drifting away and every time I try to reach you, 
it feels like I'm grabbing at smoke. I'm probably just over reacting and that you're 
probably going through something you don't want to talk about, but knowing you're 
suffering in slience makes me suffer too. More so because you refuse to talk about it.

Sometimes I wonder if I have done something wrong or broken our love in some way. 
Did I ask for too much? Was I too close? Did I hurt you? 
It's getting difficult to prove those negative thoughts wrong, but the thought that 
somewhere deep down you're still in there. The man who used to smile at me and laugh at 
my stupid jokes. The man who made me feel so special when he called me his star.

If you ever read this just know that I'll always be here waiting for you.

I love you."
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")
clip_text = true

