text = "Festival of the Nova


The system of VX-66458 is reaching its final breathtaking moment.
And you're invited to be part of history!

Join us for 7 Cycles of celebration across the neighbouring systems.

From roaring parties on orbiting stations to open-sky festivals unders the
moons, all of Solarian Space will come alive with music, lights, and the 
spirit of those who dare toast the stars themselves.

Secure your passage now!
Shuttles, accomodations, and ship parking are limited 
and are filling up fast.

This isn't just a party. It's the Festival of the Nova.

When stars die, legends are born.
Will you be there to see it?


Note from Festival organizers:
We are aware of the recent statement from the GAA about the dangers of a 
supernova.
Please also take into account that the chances of new elements or radiation 
coming from a supernova are a million to one."
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

