text = "The Farseeing Courier Company
Light Speed! Right Speed!


Established in Sol-209, The Farseeing Courier Company is the oldest and most
prestigous interstellar delivery service within The Great Solarian Systems.

Pioneers of post-FTL logistics, Farseeing Couriers was the first to harness 
humanity's crowning technological achievement, Faster-Than-Light travel, 
for commerical and civilian services. Today, we proudly deliver over 
12 million packages each cycle, ensuring that no planet is too distant, 
and no parcel is too small to warrent our unmatched precision and dedication.

With an impeccable on-time delivery rating and a reputation for zero
tolerance towards inefficiency or deviation, Farseeing Couriers stands not 
just as a courier service, but as an institution. Our reputation for 
flawless preformance and strict internal standards is not merely upheld,
it is enforced.

Whether you're shipping from the icy moons of Outer Orion or the orbital
cities of the Empyrean Twins, you can trust us to move your cargo at 
light speed, and the right speed."
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

