text = "Calihan Journal Entry 1


Another cycle, another credit.

Company sent me on this long ass haul to the middle of nowhere. 
Nice and easy job. 
Just a lot of sitting around while in transit.
Can get boring after a while but hey, atleast I'm getting paid to sit on my
ass and watch the stars go by.

Wonder what Naomi's up to. 
I should buy her a gift on the way home. A nice charm bracelet or something.
I know she's had her eye on one she saw recently.
Would make a nice surprise for when I get home.

Damn spacer sickness is getting to me again.
seems I'll probably spend most of this journey asleep.
"
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

