text = "Calihan Journal Entry 2


Woke up earlier to a purple light outside the ship.
Is that the festival everyone was going on about?
That's too bright for my liking.

Comms and Navigation are offline. 
Must have drifted off course and out of range of the ICN.

Not my first time in uncharted deep space. 
Getting back should be simple if I am not too far out.

Just need to basically rotate the ship 180 degrees and hope for the best.


Update:

How far out am I?
Been flying for like a couple hours now.

Think I can see a refueling station on the port side.
I'll head there and get my bearings.
"
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

