text = "Calihan Journal Entry 3


Think I just found the fueling station of horrors.
Or either an empty station with one crazy squatter.

That woman in there seemed... I don't know.
She looked dead but was still moving. Like something out of those old movies 
Naomi likes.

Can't get ahold of system authorities cos comms are still off.
And now my ship picked up a virus. Great, a dirty docking port.

The virus is an audio file? Might as well give it a listen.

If what this file is saying is true... I...
Need to get home.

*Log updated 3 cycles later*

Brimpie's gone and...
Naomi. She...
My light. My star.

I saw our apartment and it was.... I can still see it when I blink.

Nothing's left for me now...
Guess I'll just drift above Brimpie and slowly wither away with it.

"
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

