text = "Abandoned ship's log

Log 1: 
      Finally saved enough to buy a ship and explore. Best retirement purchase ever.

Log 2: 
      Got a map of places to see and things to do. I wish my Chloe was here to see this.

*The logs are filled with pictures of an old man trying to take selfies with different 
 types of celestial bodies*

Log 79: 
      Saw a comet today. Too fast. Couldn't get a picture.

Log 80: 
      decided to take a spacewalk when a wave of purple light hit me. Have not felt well since. 
      Some rest will help.

Log 81: 
      Still feeling sick. Cannot seem to get the comms link to work. Also why is space purple now?

Log 82: 
      Sickness getting worse. I keep thinking I am seeing things.

Log 83: 
      So hungry... Radio came to life... Could've sworn I heard her voice.... In the static... 
      but she's been dead for 3 years.

Log 84: 
      I must go... Can't take it anymore... 
      Chloe... Forgive me...
"
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

