text = "Brimpie Orbital Log


Everything has gone to hell.

People are fighting over what's left of the rations. Station admins have
given up on trying to keep the peace and just joined the rioting.
Don't blame them.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

A ship from Brimpie 2 arrived and had infected people on board. 
We had to quarantine half of the station to contain it.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Patrick's a goner.
He ran into the quarantine zone claiming he could hear the voice of his 
boyfriend in there. 

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Me and the others are thinking of stealing a ship and getting out of here 
before things get worse.

Probably do what all of other rich uptight bastards did and head off into
deep space looking for a new world."
label_settings = ExtResource("20_q0khx")

